 "id": "1013963573823261", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974526_1013963577156594_2061989920474998390_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j3sX8s_8FCYQ7kNvwHKhcvt&_nc_oc=Adkb30F2imyiF5XCP82-h5X1UPqGmBarEi5CuN8kc71Pv4C8pbuzoUjXhSjjy0xPdZ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu8TkCjfqtUCQShSn9HXUlehuG2pomyCqlqLoazjmv4ig&oe=69999696"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-05.png", "id": "2121495998306034", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982488_2121496001639367_6867377017957057624_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rUyci65XgigQ7kNvwFkomW3&_nc_oc=AdmJ0w9rYsFnu4NTVv-SRDdKg4nkm7pYitTQwwOq2miA2ieFyZAvYC-W-qi8yGVclaA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftXVrUMiy6BKM1cGLrBZxApxejuuSUI9_eBu8Rvi89KSQ&oe=6999B0AA"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-01.png", "id": "1186035523063640", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974783_1186035526396973_4771898997726366931_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QcZzciNiXVYQ7kNvwGZ7Ugh&_nc_oc=AdlPQ71ygpxJ3fqrv-Ynsdhqc_UV0_HgtuSHgDUN2tFDqB79-BWbzjLL_DqsB7XpO3Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuIpwHHMZD73XRPJ4X22eaPe_OoWmBOoEWDuKpj2mae1Q&oe=69998E8F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Cover_Image.png", "id": "487841280996149", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031435_487841284329482_7014507726029390394_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OaXw_je9BmoQ7kNvwEwlWQk&_nc_oc=Adlj3oz-K4pTQyDB-n9Hc7UFKTEw6VIaKCa0cELAsZz9hg6I0TJcCxjegTHy-iqptfw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afukn0oMHgfbiAY29FKtSTYUtVBfnZSAZXRrQR1L-XUN9w&oe=699991F1"}, "display_name": "Squingle", "keywords": ["puzzle", "mr", "puzzling", "squingle"], "long_description": "Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.\n\nYour challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called \u2018squingles.\u2019 \n\nEach level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. \n\nWith intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit.\n\n#  \u2728 100 LEVELS\nLaunching with 100 levels, with more added over time. Levels grow complex, featuring tighter spaces and new challenges.\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing sculpture, offering an unmatched visual experience in Mixed Reality or fully immersive modes.\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 EASY TO PICK, HARD TO MASTER\nDesigned to be accessible for both newcomers to VR and experts seeking a transcendent experience, with intuitive controls and hand tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c RELAX & UNWIND\nPlay on the sofa or in room-sized mazes. Squingle\u2019s calming gameplay will soothe your soul.\n\n# \ud83c\udfc5 AWARDS\n- Best VR Game ~ GDWC Finalist\n- Finalist ~ QLDXR Festival\n- \u201cBest of the Quest\u201d ~ Gibby\u2019s Guide\n\n# FEATURES\n- Challenge Mode: Time trials and global leaderboards.\n- Room/Mini scale: Play big or small!\n- Race your ghost: Beat your best times.\n\n\nGet ready to be Squingled!", "short_description": "Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.\n\nYour challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called \u2018squingles.\u2019 \n\nEach level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. \n\nWith intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit."}]}, "developer_name": "Dr. Benjamin Outram ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://squingle.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRA